<title>UK: CNA sets 2.3 bln Ffr 14-year bond.</title>
<headline>CNA sets 2.3 bln Ffr 14-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager CNCA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CNA Financial Corp</p>
<p> AMT    2.3 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.9	 MATURITY    06.JUN.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.215   PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.3	 REOFFER    99.265    SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2011 AND 2012 OAT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
